# text_id = 1040
# text = Does my right hon . Friend agree that one of the most significant decisions that the previous Government made in their final year was to devolve corporation tax to Northern Ireland — to ensure that Northern Ireland was able to compete on a far more equal footing with the Republic of Ireland — and that that should be celebrated ?
