# text_id = 1043
# text = Furthermore , we are introducing variable interest rates so that those on high incomes pay relatively more to ensure the progressivity of the scheme , as a result of which a £ 30,000 salary will carry a monthly payment of approximately £ 68 , which is far lower , incidentally , than it would be under a graduate tax system .
