# text = Does the Minister share my concern about the loss in the High Court of HMRC ’s case against the football creditors rule , and will he discuss with his ministerial colleagues whether the Government may legislate to get rid of that rule , for which even the chairman of the Football League has said he cannot find any moral justification ?
