# text = I pay particular tribute to my hon . Friend the Member for Stafford ( Jeremy Lefroy ) for his work and tireless advocacy over many years — including before he became an MP and certainly during his time in this place — on behalf of his local patients and the local hospital and staff who look after them in Mid Staffordshire .
