# text_id = 1105
# text = That is why I propose that in agreeing to this Bill , the House will endeavour to keep what is best about our current system — things like the MP - constituency link , which is envied in democracies across the world — while ensuring that we do not lock out 2 million voters who have registered to vote since 2015 .
