# text_id = 1107
# text = In Oxfordshire , 33 % of the jobs under the county council ’s future jobs fund programme were in the private sector , and the council pointed out in its evidence to the Select Committee that it had been disadvantaged by the loss of the future jobs fund — that is the county council for the Prime Minister ’s constituency .
