# text = Sue Marsh , another leading member of the Spartacus group whom I included in the delegation , discussed employment and support allowance and work capability assessments with the former Minister of State , the right hon . Member for Epsom and Ewell ( Chris Grayling ) , for 45 minutes before they appeared on “ Newsnight ” together on 12 January .
