# text_id = 1130
# text = I sympathise with the intentions behind the amendment , and I just wonder whether it was intended to tempt Eurosceptics on the Government Benches , but it is too rigid a fetter on Parliament ’s ability to manage its legislative priorities between now and 2021 , and it would risk exacerbating the very uncertainty that the Bill is designed to reduce .
