# text = Those two points are not contradictory , because while there has been a lot of money creation from which the public sector has benefited greatly by borrowing huge sums at very low prices , there has been a strict rationing of credit , particularly to smaller businesses , and a huge restriction on the balance sheets of the leading banks .
