# text_id = 1133
# text = Without wishing to be rude to the hon . Member for Inverness , Nairn , Badenoch and Strathspey , I urge Members to forget about Scotland for the moment — it is a difficult thing to do , but we will do it just for this evening — and to call on the Government to work out what is fair .
