# text_id = 1134
# text = He has touched on something that is very important , which is that , in looking forward , the Government intend to allocate £ 40 million , shared between the Department for International Development and the Foreign Office , to address the needs of Chagossians wherever they are — whether in Mauritius , the Seychelles or the United Kingdom .
