# text_id = 1136
# text = Everybody , I think , on both sides of the House knows that , when ministerial statements are delivered , I , almost without exception , allow everyone who wants to contribute the chance to do so , and , believe me , today will be no exception — I am very sensitive to the differences of opinion in the House .
