# text_id = 1137
# text = Whatever we think about a civil case , where money is involved , I hope that everyone here would say that a case involving two years of somebody ’s life — curfews and the sort of internal exile that we saw with control orders and , to a lesser extent , terrorism prevention and investigation measures — is more serious .
