# text_id = 1156
# text = Those problems were not caused by our military activity or by our armed forces ; they were caused by the disastrous politics of the decision to invade Iraq for rather naive ideological reasons as far as the Americans were concerned , and rather contrived and almost bogus ones as far as the British and some of our allies were concerned .
