# text_id = 1157
# text = It is a pleasure to be back in the House and to be speaking because , as is quite topical in this discussion , I have just returned from six months away from this place to spend time with my new baby , Eli , who is up in the Public Gallery with my husband , Eli ’s dad , Ben .
