# text = The former Lord Chancellor , the right hon . Member for Blackburn ( Mr Straw ) , not only recognised that the growth in legal aid spending that we had seen over a decade or more was , to use his word , unsustainable , but observed that the profession needed to consider not just efficiencies , but structural change .
