# text_id = 1172
# text = So the Opposition have come to this House with a motion judging the Government on the economy one year after our first Budget , yet they cannot choose one single figure by which to judge the Government ’s record , and in the end they put forward a series of disingenuous statements by which their own record would look very poor .
