# text = It is of course reasonable to flex personnel from one trade to another — a contention , I think , of paragraphs 67 to 70 of this week ’s Defence Committee report — but the majority of pinch - point trades are so specific by rank or extent of retraining necessary that it would actually be quite difficult to do so .
