# text_id = 1199
# text = In May , the Government set out a package of measures to secure the continued success and sustainability of rural schools in England , including a £ 10 million fund for expert support to help rural schools through the academy conversion process and a new double lock to sit alongside the existing presumption against the closure of rural schools .
