# text_id = 1205
# text = I worry that the only person who seems to understand or know how the fragmented NHS now operates and fits together is the former Health Secretary , the right hon . Member for South Cambridgeshire ( Mr Lansley ) , and I note that he is leaving the House of Commons at the next election , so I am a bit concerned about the situation we find ourselves in today .
