# text_id = 1206
# text = Does he find it as worrying as I do that , when challenged on passing on the Brexit preparation funding to local authorities in Scotland , the First Minister said : “ We should not be having to spend a single penny on Brexit preparations ” ? Is that not taking a political view of Brexit preparations , rather than looking at what is good for the economy of Scotland ?
