# text = I finish by saying that in addition to following through with the Portas recommendations , we want the Government to pay some attention to our four - point plan to save our high streets — cutting VAT , giving local people the power to put the heart back into the high street , repeating Labour ’s empty shops initiative and promoting a fair playing field for our high streets .
