# text = I think I am right in saying that the amendments to the European Referendum Bill — now the 2015 Act — that were agreed in the House of Lords and were then , I think , accepted here require the Government to produce a series of documents concerning the reform proposals , the alternatives to membership , and the obligations and rights that attach to membership of the European Union .
