# text = On the wider question of impartiality , does he agree that the value of Sky News is not because it makes money — it does not — but because of the benefit to the overall reputation of BSkyB that comes from the integrity , objectivity and the quality of its news gathering , and that it would therefore be madness for any new owner to seek to change that ?
