# text_id = 1227
# text = Disabled people have been punished by the gutting of ESA , by introducing the 12 - month time - limited payments for those on the contributions - based element , by the tightening of the ESA criteria and by the devastating cut to the ESA work - related activity component , worth £ 30 per week , introduced in 2017 , which has hit over 50,000 people this year .
