# text_id = 1230
# text = Has my hon . Friend noticed that the Secretary of State for Work and Pensions likes to claim that his benefits cap is responsible for the number ofpeople moving off benefits into work , yet he does not comment on the fact that roughly the same number of people are moving out of work and on to benefits , with both of those aspects being part of the usual cyclical change ?
