# text_id = 1231
# text = It has struck me in the four months that I have been doing this job that the trusts that have the best results in terms of outcomes for patients , waiting times and waiting lists , and finances are also those that are hot on this subject ; they listen to complaints and act on them , because they know that that is the way to improve their organisation .
