# text_id = 1236
# text = In many towns such as Bedford , if a person has been out for the evening with their friends , private hire vehicles and taxis are often the only answer to the question , “ Who will take me home tonight ? ” , yet drivers routinely have to deal with people who can be abusive , and may be under the influence of alcohol , drugs or both .
