# text = I welcome the Government ’s announcement of renewed action , and the Minister is doing an excellent job , working across Government , but does she agree that all of us in the Chamber must , as constituency Members of Parliament , take responsibility to call out racism when we see it , to challenge it wholeheartedly and to make sure that no racism is accepted in our communities ?
