# text_id = 1238
# text = I understand from contact with the Government in recent days that the crucial task of voter registration has started , but I would be interested to hear the Minister ’s views on what the international community can do to ensure that registration continues and that we have a passage to important presidential and parliamentary elections , and on what we can do to observe and make sure those elections go forward .
