# text = We do not spend enough time thinking about what happens to young people who do not choose to follow an academic route post - 16. I associate myself with the remarks of my hon . Friend the Member for Liverpool , West Derby ( Stephen Twigg ) , because in Darlington students do exceptionally well up to GCSE — as well as those just about anywhereelse in the country .
