# text_id = 1245
# text = For avoidance of doubt , the new clause would not create a new law in Northern Ireland , but it would recognise that there are thousands of people in Northern Ireland whose lives , right now , are affected by two key human rights issues ; and they are indeed human rights issues , because they are issues on which our courts are currently discussing , ruling and indeed appealing .
