# text_id = 1246
# text = Properly , as I indicated earlier , this is a matter for the Scottish Parliament to determine , although we are uncomfortable with the fact that using the electoral register for local government means that EU citizens who are resident in Scotland but are not British citizens will not be able to vote in a British general election , but will be able to vote to break up the United Kingdom .
