# text_id = 1253
# text = Thinking a little more radically , there is a case for clinical commissioning groups and our general practitioners to recognise the role that walking plays and , on occasion , to prescribe walking for people as a way for them to improve their life ; I agree that it may be difficult for grumpy teenagers , but there is a case to be made for encouraging more people to do this .
