# text = If we do not , and if our cities fall back to the difficulties that we had in the 1980s — frankly , the kind of funding structures being offered to us are on the road to such difficulties — it will not be only a Labour city council ’s problem , or even a Conservative city council ’s problem , it will be a problem for all of us .
