# text_id = 1257
# text = As the House knows , on 28 July , following a decision by the board of EDF to approve the final investment decision on the £ 18 billion project to build a new nuclear power plant in Somerset , I announced that the Government would consider all elements of the project carefully before entering into a contract with EDF , and that we would make a decision by the early autumn .
