# text_id = 1259
# text = However , surely it is a primary duty of Government and the state to ensure the best possible health and welfare of its citizens , and I hope that we can all agree that those with chronic health conditions , sometimes causing unimaginable pain and suffering , should not be denied the potential fruits of research into cannabinoids simply because the legislation has not kept pace with scientific progress .
