# text_id = 1260
# text = A number of families raised with me the point that when young people go to an accident or emergency centre or to their GP and are concerned about their state of mind and vulnerability , it would be a good idea for them to have somewhere like a place of safety — somewhere they can go to and be put in contact with others who understand what they are going through .
