# text_id = 1261
# text = Does the hon . Lady find it somewhat ironic that there are those on the Government Benches who are changing their mind on how they are going to vote , and indeed have already changed their vote in relation to the EU ( Withdrawal ) Act , but , for some reason , they will not allow the British people the opportunity to change their mind and change their vote ?
