# text_id = 1264
# text = Just at the moment when we need a strong voice for the United Kingdom arguing for the reforms and change of direction we need across the European economy , we get a Prime Minister saying one thing , an Education Secretary who is not here and a Defence Secretary who is not here saying another , while his Back Benchers are revolting and the Deputy Prime Minister is wielding his veto .
