# text_id = 1269
# text = The movement crystallised initially around the so - called Spartacus or “ Responsible Reform ” report , which set out an evidence - based analysis showing that the DWP had misled the public by claiming broad support for the abolition of the disability living allowance and its replacement with the new benefit of personal independence payments when there was , in fact , almost no public support at all .
