# text_id = 1270
# text = In his constructive contribution , my hon . Friend the Member for Cannock Chase ( Mr Burley ) noted that the challenges and difficulties faced in Mid Staffordshire arose because the management in particular were blinded by targets , financial incentives and drivers , and lost sight completely of what matters most in a hospital at all times , which is delivering high - quality , good patient care .
