# text = It has happened because of , as much as despite of , international mechanisms such as the UN and the International Criminal Court — mechanisms that we have all hidden behind , to a certain extent , believing that they could find the answer , as we watched them being stripped of their authority , week by week , action by action in Syria , and actually reduced to ridicule .
