# text = Following on from the question asked by my hon . Friend the Member for Westminster North ( Ms Buck ) , we now need to know that whatever recommendations are made on sprinklers , cladding , fire alarms and other remedial work , it will be central Government who provide the funds to ensure that tenants and residents in all the thousands of tower blocks throughout the country are safe .
