# text = May I inform him , as joint chairman together with the hon . Member for Central Ayrshire ( Mr. Donohoe ) of the all - party group on first past the post , that the largest contingent of that all - party group is made up of Labour Scottish MPs who have seen at first hand the chaos and mayhem that this system has brought to elections north of the border ?
