# text_id = 1282
# text = Sir Bernard is still remembered with real affection , and at my first meeting with a local campaign leader I was presented with a 30 - year - old copy of Hansard recording his marathon three - and - a - half - hour filibuster as he strove to talk out a railway Bill that would have made more likely the construction of two oil refineries on west Canvey marshes .
