# text = We have also been clear that the motion on the deal will be amendable , but I say to the right hon . Gentleman that if you went out and asked any member of the public , “ When the Government bring a deal back from Europe , what do you expect Parliament to vote on ? ” , I think they would expect Parliament to vote on the deal .
