# text = As my hon . Friend the Member for North East Fife ( Stephen Gethins ) mentioned , the ability of young people to travel through and study and work in Europe and to live as European citizens has been transformational , not just for them but for our economy — locally , in the highlands , across Scotland and , I contend , across the whole of the UK .
