# text = We know that 48.5 % of those who voted did not want any Brexit , and I cannot believe that every one of the 51.5 % who voted leave did so to make the country worse off as a result of a harsh and nasty Brexit — and make us worse off it will , as every single one of the Government ’s own sectoral and regional analyses demonstrates .
