# text = I hope that the Minister will be able , in advance of the important review that Michael Clapham will produce , to give us his full commitment to that review on behalf of the Government , as well as a clear commitment to the publication of its report , and a strong commitment to seeing the trust and the regeneration programmes continuing in our coalfields throughout this Parliament and beyond .
