# text_id = 1295
# text = My hon . Friend poses some interesting questions about the mentality of Welsh Labour MPs , but however short the time available for that debate is , I know that my right hon . Friend the Secretary of State for Wales will criticise the stewardship of the NHS in Wales and at the same time outline the steps that the coalition Government have taken to support growth in the Principality .
