# text = It is not only the smallest of our local building societies that has demonstrated innovation in recent years ; the largest of our national building societies — the Nationwide — was one of the founder lenders in the Government ’s NewBuy scheme to support first - time buyers who do not have the capital that family members sometimes provide to help people meet the deposit requirements of many lenders .
