# text_id = 1300
# text = That is just seven days on a case that might well have been built over many years , often involving jurisdictions where information is difficult to obtain , and if law enforcement decides it does not wish to give consent to these transactions , which the financial institutions themselves have said look suspicious , they have just 31 days to build the case to the satisfaction of the courts .
