# text = I believe that Governments of both persuasions have been in error over the past 30 - plus years in letting housing benefit take the strain of rising housing costs , especially given the deregulation of the private rented sector in the late 1980s , rather than investing in affordable housing supply over those three decades in a way that would have helped significantly in bringing down that total cost .
