# text = Before I go any further , I congratulate the Under - Secretary of State for Transport , my hon . Friend the Member for Scarborough and Whitby ( Mr Goodwill ) , and my right hon . Friend the Secretary of State for Transport , on taking through this evening a measure that my hon . Friend described in his peroration as being of national importance , as indeed it is .
