# text = My right hon . Friend will know that for some time I have asked for the Home Office to look at the 11 % of foreign prisoners in the Prison Service in England and Wales , see where there is dual citizenship and have that UK citizenship withdrawn from those who have committed the most serious offences , yet only a handful of people have had their citizenship withdrawn .
