# text_id = 1309
# text = While we are consulting on focusing the student visa route on universities , further education colleges and degree level courses , highly trusted sponsors will be able to offer courses at below degree level , and I would expect that the schools to which my hon . Friend has referred would be able to continue to offer courses because , as she says , they are highly trusted sponsors .
