# text = I hope the hon . Member for Kensington ( Emma Dent Coad ) will take it in the right spirit if I say that it was most solicitous and courteous of her to notify us that her family members work in the national health service , but for the avoidance of doubt , it is not necessary to declare an interest simply because one visits a doctor from time to time .
