# text = Looking at the morality of this case , and bearing in mind the fact that America — and Britain , for that matter — have lectured the world on democracy and justice , does the right hon . Gentleman agree that it is not a very good example of American justice to have a person spend 13 years in prison without ever being charged with anything and being tortured ?
