# text = That has been worked on for several years — it is under the very competent leadership of Assistant Commissioner Chris Allison — and extremely good work has been done , but we continue , of course , to ensure that we are putting in place what is necessary to do what we all want to do , which is to ensure that everybody can enjoy a secure and successful games .
