# text_id = 1320
# text = Mr. MacDermott of Motcomb street in Belgravia wrote to me before , saying : " I cannot claim poverty but I can safely say that at 77 , I might well have been happily retired rather than continuing working so as to provide for my wife and two university - aged children . " He is now 80 and sees no sign of change or resolution of the issue .
