# text = The challenge that we ought to address when we think about the future of the health service involves not just another discussion about bureaucratic structures , but how we deliver the change in the service ’s clinical model to ensure that it delivers efficient and high - quality care to the patients who present for care , rather than to the patients as so often described in the policy pamphlets .
