# text_id = 1330
# text = Being unable to participate fully in life outside the home or in public life means that such women are disempowered , forced to be dependants and end up living in a closed community — and , as we know from other communities , closed communities can sweep heinous crimes , such as child abuse , under the carpet , because they are perceived to threaten the community as a whole .
