# text = Since 2007 , we have made a number of proposals for ways to strengthen the role of the Committee , including an offer to discuss how it might hold some annual evidence sessions in public , which was raised by my right hon . Friend the Member for Pontypridd , who rightly said - I think this is more or less correct - that a patsy session is not worth having .
