# text_id = 1340
# text = A Panelbase poll for The Sunday Times found that 47 % of people in Scotland currently support independence and that more than two thirds believe that the country will be independent by 2045 . Support for independence has risen as the UK Government have failed to meet their promises on more powers ; continued with austerity ; introduced further welfare cuts ; and promoted English votes for English laws .
