# text_id = 1345
# text = Unlike my hon . Friend the Member for Liverpool , Walton ( Dan Carden ) , who is a good friend of mine , we in Wirral South never expected to see food bank usage rife in our area , which is more mixed than his , and yet here we are with this pain and stress every month , and this Government , I am afraid , are to blame .
