# text = I have to say that at the meeting I referred to in the previous debate which took place in Rome only last Friday , at which all the Chairmen of the relevant Select Committees were present , there was in fact an endorsement of my proposal , which I have been putting to various international and EU meetings over the past four months , for a review of these definitions .
