# text_id = 1350
# text = On the Britishrelationship with Pakistan , what is important at a time when it is clearly under huge challenge is obviously to talk about our counter - terrorism relationship , but also to stress all the parts of our relationship and explain that we are there for a democratic and peaceful Pakistan for the long term , just as we want to have a long - term relationship with Afghanistan .
