# text = I would be failing if I were not to draw comparisons between the broadly sensible , pragmatic approach taken by the UK Government in this instance , albeit slow , and their head - in - the - sand attitude to the cross - party consensus — which we have just heard from the Labour Front Bench — in Glasgow for progress on drug treatment facilities in that city .
