# text_id = 1360
# text = I shall not press it to a vote , but I hope that the Minister will tell us whether the Government believe that the current arrangements provide sufficient time , or whether they accept the substance of the new clause , which is that the current arrangements are insufficient and that they load the dice against law enforcement , meaning that corrupt assets can be transferred from the UK to criminals .
