# text = Resolved , That , during the year ending with 31 March 2013 , a number not exceeding 39,350 all ranks be maintained for Naval Service and that numbers in the Reserve Naval and Marines Forces be authorised for the purposes of Parts 1 , 3 , 4 and 5 of the Reserve Forces Act 1996 up to the maximum numbers set out in Votes A 2012 - 13 , HC 1735 .
