# text = What we have done in the banking industry is make sure that it is paying a £ 2.5 billion banking levy , not as a one - off , but every single year during this Parliament , so under this Government , the taxes it pays will go up ; the bonus levels have gone down ; and the lending to small businesses — and large businesses — will increase .
