# text_id = 1370
# text = The A417 missing link road scheme is important to all Members of Parliament for , and the county of , Gloucestershire , so I welcome what the Minister said and urge him to follow through on his commitments to my hon . Friend , and remind him that we will all be watching and waiting to make sure he follows through on the commitments he has made at the Dispatch Box .
